    "body": "Claim released. STOPPED before production edits.\n\nThe expanded overlap check found PR #2081 changes crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs::tool_editor_window_edits_live_and_stages_through_commands. Retiring the existing-tool window for #2014 requires updating this same function because it asserts that the window opens.\n\nPR #2081 is itself stacked on still-open PR #2027. The worker instructions allow at most one stack level and prohibit stacking on an already stacked PR. This prevents proceeding now.\n\nPR #2077 also overlaps tool_cutting_rows::cutting_rows and table_rows. A local branch was based on its head and merged upstream/main cleanly before the additional test overlap was found. No production edits or pushes were made.\n",
