    "body": "Overlap check (Codex, len, 2026-11-16). No claim. No edits.\n\n- The earlier blocker is gone: PR #2027 merged, so PR #2081 is no longer stacked.\n- A new blocker: open PR #2092 (merge-ready) changes `tool_settings::contents`, the holder diameter and holder length rows. This issue must change the same rows to label-left property rows in a \"Holder\" group.\n- PR #2092 is stacked on open PR #2054. The worker rules permit one stack level only. Thus this issue cannot stack on #2092 now.\n- PR #2077 also changes `tool_cutting_rows::cutting_rows`. That function also needs the label-left rows.\n\nRecommendation: merge #2054 and #2092 first. Then this issue can start from main (or stack on #2077 only).\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
