    "body": "The maintainer reported this again in chat on 2026-11-17, with a screenshot of the tool page in Properties:\n\n> The upper part of the tool properties page needs som.. \"Tightening\".. label and input for example should be aligned, they can easy take up 50/50 of the horizontal space..\n\nThe screenshot shows each label on its own line above its input (Type, Diameter, Corner radius, Flute length, Shank diameter, Shank length, Holder diameter, Holder length, Material group, Spindle rpm, Feed, Tool number). Each input is narrow and the right half of the panel is empty.\n\nRequested layout: one row for each setting. The label is in the left half and the input is in the right half. The body and profile editor moves out of this page: see #2397.\n",
